  "groundingSupports": [
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 764,
        "endIndex": 889,
        "text": "#### **[2] xAI Releases Grok 4.7**\n* **What is confirmed:** xAI (SpaceXAI) officially released Grok 4.7 on September 21, 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 891,
        "endIndex": 1018,
        "text": "The model features a 500k context window and API pricing starting at $2 per million input tokens / $6 per million output tokens"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1020,
        "endIndex": 1102,
        "text": "It has been made available via the xAI API, Cursor, Grok Build, and GitHub Copilot"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1199,
        "endIndex": 1334,
        "text": "1, 46.3% on CursorBench) are company-reported evaluation scores and require ongoing independent verification across developer workloads"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1767,
        "endIndex": 1827,
        "text": "Liu) and requested documents regarding OpenAI's hardware R&D"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1829,
        "endIndex": 1948,
        "text": "Apple is seeking a preliminary injunction to prevent alleged trade secret infringement in OpenAI's hardware development"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1950,
        "endIndex": 2119,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Claims regarding trade secret misuse and forensic data handling are allegations made in court documents by Apple, not established judicial facts"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2121,
        "endIndex": 2235,
        "text": "OpenAI opposes expedited discovery, arguing Apple's offboarding procedures were lax and the requests are overbroad"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2898,
        "endIndex": 3268,
        "text": "#### **[7] & [9] Alibaba Outlines 5T–10T Parameter Model Goal & Unveils Zhenwu V900 AI Accelerator**\n* **What is confirmed:** At Alibaba’s Apsara Conference in Hangzhou on September 22, 2026, CEO Eddie Wu announced plans to train a 5-trillion to 10-trillion parameter model (succeeding Qwen 3.8 Max) and set a target of 20GW global cloud data center capacity by 2032"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3270,
        "endIndex": 3395,
        "text": "Semiconductor arm T-Head unveiled the Zhenwu V900 AI accelerator, stating it triples performance over the previous generation"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        8
      ]
